From 8d9fcb26e8e3176b1d949aaf0f541c3c5594a9fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "tianxu.zhang" <tianxu.zhang@bytedance.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dsv41: expose picture resume metrics

Patch 0043 skips vision work for pictures wholly before a resumed prompt
pass, but production had no direct signal that the skip happened. Publish
four counters from the DSV lane thread through the existing status snapshot:
vision tower runs, pictures skipped by resume, pictures still needed after
resume, and picture rows installed and sent to follower ranks.

The counters add no clock reads, GPU synchronization, allocation, or second
copy of picture data. Text-only families publish no picture metrics. Server
and engine tests cover the status plumbing and Prometheus names.

---
